## Code Structures & Features

**App features general overview**: Hints, scoring systems (including subtraction based on number of hints used), ability to start a new game, random grid regeneration with each new game, and messaging systems for words guessed (“Correct,” “Incorrect,” “Invalid”, “Already found”) based on validation logic.

**Word bank (vocab)**: a list of statistics and STATS 20 related words to be found in the wordsearch.

**Random grid generation (generate_grid)**: function of random placement of 20 randomly selected words from the word bank vocabularies.

**R Shiny UI (ui)**: UI design of the playboard window of wordsearch, includes a sidebar of multiple functions (new game, hints, score, answer submission) and the wordsearch grid.

**App Server (server)**: implementation of all functions of the game into the Shiny app’s visual display window (e.g. grid generation function), and interacts with user behaviors based on our proposal’s idea.


